Z||000005||mbramble||09-11-2001||08:13 PM||||No one in my family of 6 is able to give blood because we spent time in the UK during an earlier (mid-late 80's) mad cow epedimic.  Seems a shame to cut off such a large pool of possible blood donors -- there were LOTS of U.S. military and their families over there at that time.  They won't even screen it.  When you reply yes to that question, they say no thanks.  We've been back in the States for 12 years now with no symptoms of anything.||||reg||1
